{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321115001:0":{"text":"たくさん質問できましたね。これだけ聞けば、参考になる意見もあったんじゃないですか！","source_cn":"问了这么多人，感觉收集到了不少值得参考的答案呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9AE2A2C06BDB859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321115002:0":{"text":"大聖堂、花畑、温泉旅館、スノーシダー町……うーん、やっぱり人それぞれですね。","source_cn":"我记得有白山大教堂、繁花原野、白熊温泉旅店，还有举办祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B3C7923C12E26CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321115002":{"text":"大聖堂、花畑、温泉旅館、スノーシダー町……うーん、やっぱり人それぞれですね。","source_cn":"我记得有白山大教堂、繁花原野、白熊温泉旅店，还有举办祭典时的雪松镇……唔，每个人的想法都不一样呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B3C7923C12E26CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321115004:1":{"text":"とにかく、参考になる意見はずいぶん集まった。この中に女神様の祝福の地があるはずよ！","source_cn":"不管怎么样，至少这些答案给了我一些思路。说不定女神祝福...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B7C6C8A73902DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321115005:1":{"text":"まずはスノーシダー町をぶらぶらして、祭りの雰囲気を味わってみようかしら。","source_cn":"刚好是冬日祭典期间，我准备在镇上四处逛一逛，体验一下祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7574D8429E76340B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321115006:1":{"text":"伝説の絶景を見つける日は、そう遠くないかもね！","source_cn":"说不定，用不了多久，我就能找到传说中的最美风景了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6270B0E5E3999F10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321115007:0":{"text":"うまくいきますように！","source_cn":"那就祝你一路顺利啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA4963BEBD247A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321115008:1":{"text":"もしその場所を見つけたら、ロンロンたちにも教えてくださいね！","source_cn":"要是你真的找到了那个地方，记得要告诉我们一声！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F1B53AF6598F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321115009:1":{"text":"もちろんよ！","source_cn":"当然，我一定会记得的~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2CB0FC91FEC7BE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"まぁ、これも試練だ。","source_cn":"难怪是一种考验","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01510B147EF4CAD5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"まぁ、これも試練だ。","female":"まぁ、これも試練よ。","variant_male_record_index":"69320","variant_female_record_index":"69321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"